<section class="belief section section-lg" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="belief-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we believe</span>
      <h2>
        Penetration tests reveal problems.<br />
        <span class="gradient-text italic">We prevent them.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="belief-quote">
        QueryLock is built by practitioners who&rsquo;ve sat on both sides of the pentest report
        &mdash; writing the findings, and watching the same findings come back the following year.
        The fix isn&rsquo;t another scanner. It&rsquo;s teaching the people doing the actual work.
      </p>
      <div
        style="margin-top:32px;display:inline-flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center"
      >
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">Read our story</a>
        <a href="#guides" class="btn btn-accent">Start with a free guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .belief {
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 20%,
        color-mix(in srgb, var(--ql-violet) 8%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 70%
      ),
      var(--ql-white);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .belief-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .belief-inner h2 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .belief-inner h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ql-violet) 0%, var(--ql-magenta) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .belief-quote {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
</style>
